    <entry xml:lang="en">
        <title>Session #10: Celebrating Tap 1.5</title>
        <published>2026-04-11T00:00:00+00:00</published>
        <updated>2026-04-11T00:00:00+00:00</updated>
        
        <author>
          <name>
            
              Unknown
            
          </name>
        </author>
        
        <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://nilsmango.ch/live/session-010/"/>
        <id>https://nilsmango.ch/live/session-010/</id>
        
        <content type="html" xml:base="https://nilsmango.ch/live/session-010/">&lt;p&gt;Sorry it took me so long to get episode 10 out, I have been very busy finishing some things for Tap. Which. Is. Now 100% the best Ableton Live controller out there, so good, so really good now!! &lt;a rel=&quot;noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; href=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;project7iii.com&#x2F;tap&quot;&gt;Try Tap for free!&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;&lt;br &#x2F;&gt;
I still found some bugs in Tap I need to fix during this live set. I also had some crazy audio glitches where I had to stop everything and restart the audio in Ableton Live. I need to find out why it sometimes starts adding those strange artifacts.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Used in this session: iPad with &lt;a rel=&quot;noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; href=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;project7iii.com&#x2F;tap&quot;&gt;7III Tap&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;, &lt;a rel=&quot;noopener&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; href=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;ableton.com&#x2F;live&quot;&gt;Ableton Live&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;. All synths are stock Ableton Live instruments. Never had to use the computer (only when I had to restart the audio in Ableton Live), so Tap really works now with the improved encoders&#x2F;macros and the simple but awesome browser.&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;video&quot;&gt;Video&lt;&#x2F;h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you don’t like audio-only, here’s a YouTube video of the live session:
&lt;div class=&quot;youtube&quot;&gt;
&lt;lite-youtube videoid=&quot;p13gch-RQ5Y&quot; playlabel=&quot;Play: Keynote (Google I&#x2F;O &#x27;18)&quot; class=&quot;tvframe&quot; params=&quot;start=0&amp;modestbranding=2&amp;autoplay=1&amp;rel=0&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;lite-youtube&gt;
&lt;script src=&quot;&#x2F;lite-yt-embed.js&quot;&gt;&lt;&#x2F;script&gt;
&lt;&#x2F;div&gt;
&lt;&#x2F;p&gt;
</content>
        
